  "description": "With design cues lifted and adapted from our multi-purpose adult HYB hybrid range, the JNR 16\" provides the perfect progression from balance bike to pedal bike. A light, triple-butted alloy frame and fork make the bike easy to pedal and balance. The same one-piece bar and stem as our balance model keeps things clean and simple. For those moving up from our balance model, the familiarity reduces cognitive overload, allowing little ones to focus on the new task at hand - pedalling.\n\nThe first few times starting from a standstill are hard enough without a monster gear that needs to be turned, so JNR 16\" uses a single gear set-up that offers the best of both worlds. Easy enough to get spinning but big enough to build up speed as their confidence grows. And once it does, the fast-rolling Vee Speedster tyres will provide plenty of grip, and short-reach brake levers designed for small hands are there to keep things under control.",
